# The local website needs no API keys. Vite proxies /api to 127.0.0.1:8001.
# Start the system project's commerce service with: npm run dev:commerce
# InvenTree, Mercado Pago and Mercado Livre credentials must remain server-side.
# Public build-time link for the staff portal. HTTPS is required off loopback.
# An origin gets /web/login appended; an explicit HTTPS login path is also valid.
# Rebuild after changing this value. An unsafe value disables the factory link.
# VITE_FACTORY_URL=https://172.235.144.185:8443
